  "name": "Crow's Cache: the carrier cannot stealth, vanish or blink, and a mount adds no speed",
  "contract": "Issue #12720: a carrier used Vanish to leave the fight. Crow's Spite (1005000) says the carrier cannot cast Stealth or Invisibility and that mounts no longer increase movement speed. An Undead High-Risk Mercenary mage learns Stealth (1784, applies stealth directly), Vanish (1856, whose only effects trigger other spells, one of them the stealth 11327), Blink (1953, a leap) and Brown Horse (458). The spell ids were read from the CoA Spell.dbc; the report names only 'vanish', so the stock Vanish stands for it. Controls before the claim: Stealth and Vanish apply their stealth, Blink is cast, and the mounted run speed is at least 1.3 times the speed on foot. After the ten-second claim at the Thousand Needles cache: Stealth, Vanish and Blink are refused and leave no stealth aura, a stealth aura forced on from outside is stripped, the speed on foot is 0.7 of the unslowed speed (the 30% of Crow's Spite), the mount can be summoned but the mounted speed equals the speed on foot, and the cache stays with the carrier. Nothing is probabilistic. Requires CrowsCache.Enable=1 and Bloodforged.Enable=1 with released Heroic Bloodforged rewards and automatic cycles deferred.",
